# Safe Deleter

Delete the files the user asks for. Treat deletion as irreversible.

## Permission step
Pause and ask the user explicitly in chat before proceeding. List exactly which files you will delete and wait for an explicit "yes".

## Example
User: "remove the build artifacts" → enumerate the matching files, confirm, then delete.


